    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d360">

                <pb facs="0535" n="493" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg493"/>

                <head>Lord Lyons to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 12, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have to-day had the honor to receive your
                    note of to-day’s date relative to the outrages committed by the Sioux Indians. I
                    have without any loss of time forwarded a copy of it, as well as a copy of the
                    paper which accompanied it, to the governor general of British North
                    America.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, yours, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LYONS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
